msgstr "数据如何收集"

msgid "In the paths, {NET} is mainnet or testnet. Amounts are in duffs (1 DASH = 100,000,000 duffs) except Platform amounts, which are in credits (1 DASH = 100,000,000,000 credits). Times are unix seconds."
msgstr "路径中的 {NET} 为 mainnet 或 testnet。金额以 duff 计（1 DASH = 100,000,000 duff），Platform 金额除外，以 credits 计（1 DASH = 100,000,000,000 credits）。时间为 Unix 秒。"

msgid "It is a regular masternode, and this view counts evonodes. The ring marks where it is."
msgstr "它是普通主节点，而此视图统计 Evonode。圆环标出它的位置。"

msgid "It is an evonode, and this view counts regular masternodes. The ring marks where it is."
msgstr "它是 Evonode，而此视图统计普通主节点。圆环标出它的位置。"

msgid "It is enabled, and this view counts PoSe-banned masternodes only. The ring marks where it is."
msgstr "它处于启用状态，而此视图只统计被 PoSe 封禁的主节点。圆环标出它的位置。"

msgid "It is PoSe-banned, so it is not counted here. The ring marks where it is."
msgstr "它已被 PoSe 封禁，因此此处不计入。圆环标出它的位置。"

msgid "It is the only counted masternode in {city}."
msgstr "它是 {city} 唯一计入的主节点。"

